    "description": "Title\n: Natural Rock Lot Collectibles 11.50 Pounds Mixed Rough Stones Bulk As Is\nColor\n: Mixed Brown and Clear\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nCategory\n: Collectibles\nBrand\n: NATURAL\nStyle\n: 11.50 lbs\nType\n: Rock Lot\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Explore a diverse collection of natural rough stones with this 11.50 lb rock lot. Ideal for collectors and craft enthusiasts, this assortment features an array of mixed brown and clear stones in various shapes and sizes. Each stone displays its own unique texture and coloration, making the lot visually engaging and full of potential for display or educational uses.\nThese rocks are unpolished and untreated, providing an authentic and untouched appearance. The large and small pieces offer opportunities for sorting, tumbling, lapidary projects, or simply showcasing as part of a mineral collection. Their solid, durable structure ensures they can withstand handling and various creative applications.\nAll rocks included are as seen in the images, with natural surface characteristics and occasional inclusions. The overall condition is intact, with no visible major cracks or breaks beyond natural irregularities. This lot is perfect for anyone looking to grow their collection with genuine, natural mineral specimens.\n11.50 lbs NATURAL Rock Lot\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. F